<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project Sdk="Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>0.1.0.0</Version>
    <!-- Manifest fields (see https://github.com/goatcorp/DalamudPackager/blob/827d88dc/DalamudPackager/DalamudPackager.cs#L420) -->
    <Author>Cellar Mander</Author>
    <Name>Say My Name</Name>
    <Punchline>Get a sound and highlighted chat when other players mention you.</Punchline>
    <Description>Alerts you when other players call for you in chat, so you notice even while busy or looking away.

Alert Triggers:
• Name: your character's name or nicknames, even stretched (Aliiice) or spelled out (A-L-I-C-E)
• Custom: your own words and phrases
• You: a player targeting you says "you", "your", "thou", "thine" and the like
• Emote: a player uses an emote on you, including motion-only emotes
• Target Speaks: your current target says something while targeting you

Each alert can play a sound, colour the matched words and colour inactive chat tabs that show the line. Choose the channels each alert listens on, a quiet time between sounds, and the colours.</Description>
    <RepoUrl>https://github.com/Cellar-Mander/say-my-name</RepoUrl>
    <IconUrl>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Cellar-Mander/say-my-name/v$(Version)/SayMyName/images/icon.png</IconUrl>
    <Tags>chat;alert;notification;sound;highlight;social</Tags>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="images\icon.png" CopyToOutputDirectory="PreserveNewest" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\SayMyName.Core\SayMyName.Core.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
